1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,300
姑娘们 我需要你们听我说件事
Girls, I need your attention.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,500
在大多数的地方 你还需要儿童垫高椅呢
You also need a booster seat for most places.

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,680
不是 我出来是要跟你们说件大事
No, I came out to tell you some big news.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:12,800
你穿这毛衣来上班时
You also came out

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,440
也从出来变成出柜了
when you wore that sweater to work today.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,520
约翰·梅尔拍时尚杂志的同款好吗
John Mayer wore this sweater in Details.

7
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,100
今晚 我们要试试家庭式服务
Tonight, we are trying family-style service.

8
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,860
我还以为家庭式服务
I thought family-style service was

9
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,000
是指我叔叔让我"做"的那些事呢
what I had to do with my uncle.

10
00:00:26,136 --> 00:00:30,300
我家庭的风格是"百乐餐"
Well, my family-style is more "potluck"--

11
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,640
百倍大麻
heavy on the pot,

12
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,700
乐子砍半
not so heavy on the luck.

13
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,520
为什么会有家庭来这里
Why would a family come here?

14
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:40,060
如果我看到有小孩进来 我会打给警察叔叔
If I see a child in here, I'm calling the police.

15
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,620
就像大热天看到有狗被锁在车里一样
It's like seeing a dog locked in a hot car.

16
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,688
猎人烤鸡 家庭风
Chicken cacciatore , family-style.

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,400
洋葱炒肝 家庭风
Liver and onions, family-style.

18
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,740
肉丸意面 我的家庭风
Spaghetti and meatballs, my family-style,

19
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:55,400
也就是"肉丸"有点小
which means the balls are kinda small,

20
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,920
但是"意面"绝对是"加长版"
but the noodles are extra long.

21
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,780
你们把装有食物的大盆子端出去
You bring out the food in large bowls

22
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,680
客人可以自助取餐
and the customers serve themselves,

23
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:07,000
反正我雇了你们俩后 顾客基本靠自助
as they've been doing since I hired you two.

24
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,680
好主意啊 阿憨
Good idea, Han.

25
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,660
餐厅的食物的确适合放大盆子里
The diner food does belong in a big bowl--

26
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,160
放屎盆子里
the toilet bowl.

27
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,360
我真不知道你叔叔是看上你哪点
I don't know what your uncle saw in you.

28
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:36,420
麦克斯 我在手机上发现非常糟心的东西
Max, I just found something very upsetting on my phone.

29
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,340
苹果又硬要送U2乐团的专辑了吗
Another free U2 album?

30
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:41,020
更惨
Worse.

31
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:44,020
比受邀请去看朋友的即兴剧团演出还惨
And worse than an e-vite to a friend's improv show.

32
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,420
我收到一封电邮
It's an e-mail from the managing director

33
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:51,080
是管理"嗨翻天"所有门店的总经理发的
of all The High restaurants saying he's seen our sales

34
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:53,279
他说对我们的业绩与表现很不满
and is disappointed with my performance.

35
00:01:53,279 --> 00:01:56,540
切 删了
Duh-lete...

36
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:59,680
那些男人在炮后发给我的"不满意"短信
like I do with all the "disappointed in your performance" texts

37
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,300
我也都是直接删掉啊
I get from guys after sex.

38
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,740
男士们 抱歉
Sorry, gents!

39
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,360
我的胸器许下了
My boobs makes a promise

40
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,740
我的弱背做不到的承诺
my bad back can't deliver.

41
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:10,880
业绩难看不是我们的错
Those bad sales numbers are not our fault.

42
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:12,660
我们的店在机场角落
Our unit's out at the airport.

43
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,800
那是你的店
Well, I'm not taking ownership of this

44
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,560
因为我的那根"电"不在机场
because my unit is not at the airport.

45
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,000
而是在我的床头柜里
It's in my bed table drawer.

46
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,140
我是经理 责任在我
I'm the manager. It's on me.

47
00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:25,439
就像这调味酱渍 在我身衣服上这死不出来
As is this tartar stain. It just refuses to come out.

48
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:29,210
死不出来[柜]的程度 像它爸妈是浸信会的
You'd think it's parents were Baptist.

49
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,380
经理大人 我明天得早退
Well, Manager, I need to get out of there

50
00:02:32,380 --> 00:02:34,220
我得去做苏菲的婚礼蛋糕
early tomorrow to do Sophie's wedding cake,

51
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,980
还因为你是个讨人厌的老板
and also because you're annoying as a boss.

52
00:02:37,086 --> 00:02:39,696
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

53
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:46,500
我 我 我 我 我
Me, me, me, me, me,

54
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:48,020
我 我 我 我
me, me, me, me...

55
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:50,200
我好爱当新娘的这段时间
I love being a bride.

56
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:53,100
因为我都不用假装我在乎别人的事
You don't even have to pretend it's about anyone else.

57
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:56,420
跟我有点像 我有钱那会也这样
Kinda like me, when I was rich.

58
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,080
现在的你每天也还是如此啊
Pretty much every single day still.

59
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:01,040
有好消息 也有坏消息
Good news, bad news.

60
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,740
好消息是皮疹到我的蛋蛋就没再扩散
The good news is the rash is not spreading past my nuts.

61
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:10,220
而这还是他的好消息
And that's the good news.

62
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,700
坏消息是 我们预定好的
Bad news-- the wedding donkey we booked

63
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:15,660
在教堂婚礼出现的驴子死掉了
for the church service died.

64
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,980
我来问一个明摆着的问题
I'll ask the obvious question.

65
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,800
它是因为被"传染"皮疹而死吗
Did it have anything to do with the rash?

66
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:24,660
那我们该怎么办
I mean, what are we gonna do?

67
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,820
如果没有一头傻驴走红毯
It's not a traditional Polish wedding

68
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:29,000
就算不上是传统波兰式婚礼了
without an ass walking down the aisle.

69
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,640
"傻驴走红毯"的这事奥列格承包了
I think Oleg's got that covered.

70
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:37,160
姑娘们 我们需要头驴子 你们有匹马
Girls, we need an ass, you have a horse--

71
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,040
同科[家] 但没血缘关系
same family, but not related,

72
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,940
就像朱莉-皮特家的那帮孩子
like the Jolie-Pitt kids.

73
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,980
不行 栗宝是我的宝贝
No way. Chestnut is my baby.

74
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,340
那头驴子本来有一千块钱酬劳呢
Well, the donkey was getting a thousand bucks.

75
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:50,678
宝贝得工作啦
Baby's gotta work.

76
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,620
来客人的速度比第三季的
Wow, business is slower than the third season

77
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:56,520
《纸牌屋》的进度还慢
of House of Cards.

78
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,820
但你知道谁那里很来人吗
You know what's doing great business?

79
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:01,540
我的基佬约炮软件个人主页
It's my new Grindr profile.

80
00:04:04,020 --> 00:04:06,660
把我的账户名改成了"高速真空吸引鸡"
Changed my screen name to "Suction Junction".

81
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:11,880
隔壁的"肉桂卷"面包店抢了我们所有生意
That damn Cinnabon next door is taking all our business.

82
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:14,140
没见识的人才会宁愿吃那些
What kind of low lives would prefer those

83
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:15,700
也不来吃我们的高档甜点呢
to these fine desserts?

84
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,820
我找到了去肉桂卷后厨的秘密通道
I found a secret pathway to the Cinnabon kitchen!

85
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,100
贱货 闪开
Move, bitch!

86
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:25,180
不是吧 你也沦陷了
Really? You too?

87
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:26,500
我实在是不懂啊
I just don't get it.

88
00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:29,100
尝过才会懂 就像冰毒一样
It's an acquired taste, like crystal meth.

89
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:35,920
太棒了 我请的服务员又要迟到了
Great. My waiter's gonna be late again.

90
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:37,660
"被运输安全局拦下来了"
"Held up at the TSA line."

91
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,820
请一个叫默罕默德·马赫丁吉哈德的人
That's what I get for hiring an airport waiter

92
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:43,032
来当机场服务员 我真是自找麻烦
named Mohammed Machdinajihad.

93
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,760
看 洛妮 新店呢
Oh, look, Ronnie, a new place.

94
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,740
我看到了 波妮 我就在你旁边
I see it, Bonnie, I'm right next to you.

95
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:52,140
这里不是以前我们上机前
Didn't this used to be the bar we got wasted in

96
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:52,840
喝得烂醉的酒吧吗
before our flights?

97
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,600
我记不得 当时太醉了
I can't remember. I was wasted.

98
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,900
欢迎来到嗨翻天
Welcome to The High--

99
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:00,600
赞到翻天的高品质甜点
the finest in high quality desserts.

100
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:03,180
我们也有酸奶 卡布奇诺 拿铁 咖啡
We also have yogurts, cappuccinos, lattes, coffee,

101
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:04,340
花草茶与高档矿泉水
herb teas, or smart waters.

102
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,220
我告诉你们本店还有付费无线网热点了吗
And did I mention we're a Boingo Hotspot?

103
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:09,120
收敛点好吗
Take it down a notch.

104
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,080
你硬要讨人喜欢的程度
You're selling it harder than Anne Hathaway

105
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:11,960
比安妮·海瑟薇上《今夜秀》时还夸张
on The Tonight Show.

106
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:15,360
你们好 我不是来买的 我就看看
Oh, hi, I'm not here to buy, just to look.

107
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,200
我在减肥
On a diet...

108
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,520
从1998年就开始减了
since 1998.

109
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:20,660
天啊 它们看起来好赞
Oh dear lord, those look amazing.

110
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,580
-我能闻一下吗 -波妮 别
- Can I just smell a piece? - Bonnie, don't.

111
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:25,400
那会唤醒你的馋虫 我们飞到巴黎的途中
It'll get you going, and then halfway to Paris,

112
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:28,100
我又会抓到你躲在经济舱狂吃薯片
I'll find you in coach binging on a bag of Sun Chips.

113
00:05:28,740 --> 00:05:30,300
这是我的工作里我最喜欢的一部分
That's my favorite thing about the job.

114
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:35,260
说到巴黎我就想到
Oh, Paris reminds me.

115
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:37,200
我买了两张去巴黎的头等舱机票
I bought two first class tickets to Paris--

116
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,680
刷三张信用卡 分期六年 多还20%的钱
on three credit cards that will escalate 20% over six years--

117
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,000
反正就是
anyway...

118
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:42,160
我真的需要把这票给退了
I really need to return them.

119
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,720
你们航空公司的退款期限是多久
What's the window on that with your airline?

120
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,560
一个月 大概跟我脸上这假笑
A month--about the same amount of time I have

121
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,820
终于笑不出来的时间差不多长
until this fake smile finally falls off my face.

122
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:51,180
妹子 我们是空姐
Lady, we're flight attendants.

123
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:52,780
如果你脸上那笑容没了
If that smile falls off your face,

124
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,300
那你估计就得去西南航空找工作了
you're gonna have to get a job at Southwest.

125
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,680
为什么要退货啊 你不喜欢巴黎吗
Why are you returning them? You don't like Paris?

126
00:05:58,580 --> 00:06:00,500
爱死巴黎了 但要长话短说嘛...
J'adore Paris, but long story short--

127
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,300
我来帮你吧 因为她从来不懂短说
Uh, I'll make it short because she's incapable

128
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:04,120
而且还会多说一大堆假法语
and will throw in lots more of that fake French.

129
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,760
我们买票是为了去见一个
Bought the tickets so that I could get to the gate

130
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,893
当时的炮友小帅哥
to see a guy I was banging.

131
00:06:07,893 --> 00:06:09,380
我懂你
I hear ya.

132
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:11,680
我有一次躲在行李车里12个小时
I once hid in the luggage cart for 12 hours

133
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,880
就为了去见一个在海关工作的男的
to do it with this cute guy who works at customs here.

134
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:16,720
对 叫瑞克 他最近在干嘛
Oh, right. Rick. What's he doing now?

135
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,440
干我 每隔三周的周二开干
Me, every third Tuesday.

136
00:06:19,775 --> 00:06:22,268
姐妹们跟我也来击个掌
Ahh, don't leave me hanging, ladies.

137
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:25,860
要不是我们才在酒会读完《向前一步》
Ah. If we hadn't just read Lean In in our wine club--

138
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:26,720
我是说读书会
I mean book club--

139
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:29,020
我们一定会超嫉妒你们俩
We'd be real jealous of you gals.

140
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:31,220
我们一直梦想要在机场开家店
We always had a dream to open a shop at the airport.

141
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,660
无论你们想开什么 千万别开在肉桂卷隔壁
Well, whatever it is, just don't open near a Cinnabon

142
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,180
因为你的失败会有一股浓浓的肉桂味
because failure smells a hell of a lot like cinnamon.

143
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:39,400
前往巴黎的24号航班最后登机宣布
Final boarding call for flight 24 to Paris.

144
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:40,640
最后登机广播
Final boarding call.

145
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:43,020
最后登机广播了呀 那我们得快点啊
Final boarding call? We better hurry.

146
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:58,180
这里的一切突然看起来
Wow, everything looks so much smaller in here

147
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:59,420
比我印象中小啊
than I remembered it.

148
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:01,160
就像是回到当年高中母校
Like returning to your old high school...

149
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,340
或者是回想当年男朋友的小鸡鸡
or your old high school boyfriend's penis.

150
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:06,880
我的不是 我去的可是城里的高中
Not mine. I went to an urban high school.

151
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:11,100
怎么有股奇怪的味道
What's that weird smell?

152
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:13,600
大概是那罐牛奶吧 在这里太久了
Probably that milk. It's been in here so long,

153
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,040
瓶子上的照片是都变它自己了
its own photo was on the carton.

154
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:19,640
是在这里 好刺鼻的一股味儿
No, it's over here. Really pungent.

155
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:24,260
太棒了
Yes!

156
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:34,100
我可能欠了你们两位一点房租
Mm-- I might owe you two some rent.

157
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,940
除非你们愿意收大麻抵债
Unless you wanna settle in weed.

158
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,520
我一直都很乐意收大麻抵债[定居]
I always wanna settle in weed.

159
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,260
其实我还计划在那里退休
In fact, I plan to retire there.

160
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,800
柜里藏大麻
Marijuana's in the closet?

161
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,540
这比梅勒迪斯·巴克斯特出柜还让人吃惊
This is more shocking than Meredith Baxter-Birney.

162
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:53,340
我想既然你们俩不要这小蛋糕店了
Look, I figured since you two abandoned the cupcake shop,

163
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,520
这地方不用也是浪费
this space was available.

164
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:57,140
而且打从我70岁过后
Also, I stopped asking permission for stuff

165
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,060
我就不再征求别人许可了
when I turned 70.

166
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,940
我们没有不要这里好吗
We did not abandon it.

167
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:02,840
我们只是没怎么理它三个月了而已
We just haven't paid attention to it in 3 months,

168
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,160
就像我对我大腿中段以上的毛发一样
like me with any hair above my mid-thigh.

169
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,640
还说呢
Tell me about it.

170
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:08,120
你穿着那裙子弯腰的时候
When you bend over in that skirt,

171
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,020
我还以为你要生出爆炸头男星了
it looks like you're giving birth to Art Garfunkel.

172
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:17,940
我 我 我 我 我 我 我
Me, me, me, me, me, me, me!

173
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:21,180
太好了 厄尔 你在这
Oh, good. Earl, you're here.

174
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:24,040
是的 请不要跟我任何一位前妻说
Yes, I am. Don't tell any of my ex-wives.

175
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:28,680
厄尔 我有荣幸邀请你
Earl, would you do me the honor

176
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,080
明晚婚礼上牵着我走红毯吗
and walk me down the aisle tomorrow night?

177
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,760
苏菲 抱歉
Sophie, sorry.

178
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:34,360
我不知道你的父亲已经去世了
I didn't know your father was dead.

179
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:36,120
他是在见奥列格时死的吗
Did he die upon meeting Oleg?

180
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,440
他没死啦
Oh, he's not dead,

181
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:42,640
但我可不想被一个铁肺给抢走众人目光
but I'm not getting upstaged by an iron lung.

182
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:46,740
厄尔 你怎么忍心拒绝
Well, Earl, how could you say no

183
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:48,240
这么"诚心"的邀请呢
to such a heartfelt request?

184
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,800
苏菲 能牵你走是我莫大荣幸
I'd be honored, Sophie.

185
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,460
就像婚礼常说到的
Like the wedding saying goes,

186
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,580
旧的东西 新的东西
Something old, something new,

187
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:55,600
借的东西
something borrowed,

188
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,080
与黑色人类
and someone black.

189
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,700
卡洛琳 看
Oh, Caroline, look.

190
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:02,880
这是给栗宝戴的粉色缎带
Here are the pink ribbons for Chestnut.

191
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:06,200
栗宝身上非得系这么女生的缎带吗
Chestnut has to be covered in girly ribbons?

192
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,856
我怎么能这么对我的儿子
I can't do that to my boy.

193
00:09:07,856 --> 00:09:10,000
我再加50块
I'll throw in another 50.

194
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,700
我想"马"子跟婊子这么音似
I guess there's a reason "horse" sounds

195
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:13,060
是有原因的
so much like "whore."

196
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:16,631
我们明晚6点出发去教堂
Now, we're all gonna leave for the church at 6:00,

197
00:09:16,631 --> 00:09:19,098
但我跟厄尔说了4点
but I told Earl 4:00,

198
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:22,680
原因...我想你也懂
'cause, well... you know.

199
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,240
你这是怎么回事
What's happening over there?

200
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,460
麦克斯 你在哼歌
Max, you're humming!

201
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,160
什么
What?

202
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:36,560
别闹了
Please...

203
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:38,280
我才不哼歌[悍马]呢
I am not a hummer.

204
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:39,520
我只可能开着悍马
I mean, I'll drive in them,

205
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,180
帮人哼哼口交 但绝对不会哼歌
I'll give them, but I am not one.

206
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:47,700
天啊 我真的在哼歌 我是哪里有问题
Oh, my God, I am humming! What's wrong with me?

207
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:49,460
接下来我还会怎么样 微笑吗
What am I gonna do next, smile?

208
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:54,580
没错 今天的特别促销活动
That's right! Today's special promotion,

209
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:55,660
进店到出店只需五分钟
in and out in five minutes

210
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,020
超时甜品一律半价
or your dessert is half off.

211
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,020
吃屎吧 肉桂卷
Eat it, Cinnabon.

212
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:00,479
梨子果馅饼与咖啡
Pear tart and a coffee.

213
00:10:00,479 --> 00:10:01,745
速度点啊 我这时间紧迫
Come on, I'm on a clock here.

214
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:03,340
他妈谁的梨子果馅饼与咖啡
Who had the damn pear tart and a coffee?

215
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:06,600
麦克斯 快点 五分钟进出
Max, hurry! Five minutes, in and out!

216
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,240
这世上唯一一件不需要你来教我的事
Yeah, the one thing you don't have to explain

217
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,140
就是"进与出"
to me is "in and out."

218
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:11,960
我需要帮忙 我从没说过我快
I need help! I never said I was fast.

219
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,540
我所有的高中辅导员都很"快"
All my high school guidance counselors did,

220
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:14,260
但我可没有
but I did not.

221
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:16,280
我去让强哥结束休息时间
I'll go get John off break

222
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,000
因为我们的服务员还是没到
because my waiter still isn't here.

223
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,320
这整个与中东的紧张关系
This whole Middle East situation

224
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,920
真是给我造成大大的不便
is just so inconvenient for me.

225
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:26,000
好的 现在我们有个真的大问题了
Okay, now we have a real situation.

226
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:27,780
你打人了 靠 麦克斯
You hit someone. Damn it, Max.

227
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:29,960
跟我无关 是苏菲
It's not about me. It's Sophie.

228
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,320
她的婚纱从波兰寄到了
Her gown arrived from Poland

229
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,320
