and it's stuck in customs out here.

230
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:34,975
我的婚纱
My gown!

231
00:10:34,975 --> 00:10:37,054
我漂漂的婚纱
My beautiful gown!

232
00:10:37,054 --> 00:10:40,880
天啊 我的婚纱
Oh, my God! My gown!

233
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,720
看来她很不开心啊
Wow. She is really upset.

234
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,820
是非常不开心
Really upset,

235
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,320
没按免提都已经这音量了
'cause this isn't even on speaker.

236
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:51,221
的确很棘手 但往好的一面看
Yes, it's awful, but look on the bright side.

237
00:10:51,221 --> 00:10:53,231
我们绝对丑死人不偿命的伴娘服
Our certain-to-be-hideous bridesmaids dresses

238
00:10:53,740 --> 00:10:54,860
