are stuck in customs too.

239
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:56,180
没 伴娘服过关了
No, those arrived.

240
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,540
靠 先有中东问题
Damn it! First, it's the Middle East,

241
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,420
然后伴娘服又来了
now those dresses.

242
00:11:00,420 --> 00:11:01,900
我真是一刻都不能休息啊
I cannot catch a break.

243
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:05,740
哇 这里人好满啊
Wow, this place is packed.

244
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,600
还记得我们吗 波妮与洛妮
Remember us? Bonnie and Ronnie?

245
00:11:07,660 --> 00:11:08,240
我们之前认识的
We knew you when.

246
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:10,720
等等 洛妮
Hey, wait, uh, Ronnie,

247
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:12,840
你上次不是说你在跟一个海关人员搞吗
didn't you say that you boned a guy in customs?

248
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:15,280
是波妮 我是有节操的人
That was Bonnie. I have standards...

249
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,760
而且他不喜欢我
and he didn't like me.

250
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:20,300
我解释一下 我的确是有跟海关人员上床
To be clear, I did have sex with the customs guy,

251
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:21,380
但不是在海关里搞
but not in customs.

252
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:23,120
我们是在家庭厕所里开搞
It was in one of those family bathrooms.

253
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,700
你有任何方法能够帮我们
Look, is there any way you could help us

254
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:27,860
从海关那里弄出一个包裹吗
get a package out of customs?

255
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:30,120
等等 我今天穿哪件胸罩
Wait... What bra am I wearing?

256
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:31,760
没问题
Oh, done!

257
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,140
强哥 我们有事先走 这里交给你了
John, we're leaving. You're in charge.

258
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,420
麦克斯 我们不能现在走啊
Max! We can't leave right now.

259
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,100
婚礼是今晚才开始 而我们正在
The wedding's not till tonight and we're in the middle

260
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:43,060
店铺促销活动中 而且要输了
of a store promotion and we're losing.

261
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:44,940
你知道我会宰了你对吧
You know I'm gonna kill you, right?

262
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,580
等我想好怎么宰就动手
I just have to figure out how.

263
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:48,400
目前最有可能的是把你的项链
Top contender is hooking your necklace

264
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:49,880
勾到前门上 然后让门往上升
on the front gate and pushing up.

265
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,280
我们能留多久是多久
We'll stay as late as possible.

266
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:55,240
到时候再去领苏菲的婚纱盒然后跳上地铁
Just pick up Sophie's dress box and hop on the subway.

267
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,180
轻轻松松
Easy peasy.

268
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,540
请注意 列车车门即将关闭
Watch the closing doors, please.

269
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:05,620
为什么任何事都不是轻轻松松
Why is nothing easy peasy?

270
00:12:11,340 --> 00:12:13,200
请注意 列车车门即将关闭
Watch the closing doors, please.

271
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,680
我很注意了好吗
I am watching the doors!

272
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:17,420
很难不注意 车门都要吃了我箱子了
It's hard not to. They're about to eat my box.

273
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,937
哈哈哈 好好笑
Yeah, real funny, sir.

274
00:12:21,937 --> 00:12:25,029
有妞说"吃我箱子[阴户]" 幼稚鬼
A girl said, "eat my box." grow up.

275
00:12:26,940 --> 00:12:29,480
天啊 婚纱怎么能这么大件呢
Jeez! How could a dress be this big?

276
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,040
这还只是头纱
This is just the veil.

277
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,020
我得从包包里拿点东西出来
I have to get something out of my bag.

278
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:35,220
你自己先扶一下
Hold this by yourself for a second.

279
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:40,540
我找不到了 给 拿着这个
I can't find it. Here, take this.

280
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:41,835
这是什么
What is this?

281
00:12:41,835 --> 00:12:43,960
一百块钱硬币
A hundred dollars in change.

282
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,840
婚礼要用的
We need it for the wedding.

283
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,980
朝新娘扔硬币是波兰的传统
It's a Polish custom to throw change at the bride.

284
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:49,640
扔硬币 活动物
Loose change? Live animals?

285
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,500
这是婚礼还是斗鸡赛啊
Is this a wedding or a cock fight?

286
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,440
麦克斯 这个好沉啊
Max, this is heavy!

287
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:56,000
你要从包包里拿什么东西呀
What do you have to get out of your bag?

288
00:12:56,100 --> 00:12:58,340
-重要的东西 -是什么
- Something important. - What is it?

289
00:12:58,380 --> 00:12:59,760
吃剩的肉桂卷
The rest of my Cinnabon.

290
00:13:00,780 --> 00:13:02,580
麦克斯 那可是我们的竞争对手
Max, that's our competition!

291
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,780
我们业绩失败就是因为那破玩意
The reason for our failure is that piece of crap.

292
00:13:04,940 --> 00:13:06,000
我是说...
I mean, I ca--

293
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,960
哇靠 真好吃
Oh, my God, this is delicious!

294
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:12,820
不 麦克斯 他要抢我们的钱袋
No! Max, he's got the money bag.

295
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:18,520
不 不许捡 不许捡
No-- No! No, no, no!

296
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:20,120
那可是我们波兰新娘的钱
That is our Polish bride money!

297
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:21,980
走开
Back off!

298
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,060
今天可不是招惹姐的好日子
This is not the day to screw with me.

299
00:13:24,260 --> 00:13:25,580
姐的业绩垫底
I'm at the business bottom

300
00:13:25,580 --> 00:13:27,960
而且从2011年后 姐穷得什么都不怕了
and I've had nothing to lose since 2011.

301
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:34,300
皇后[变装]广场站到了
Queen's Plaza.

302
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:38,280
是啊 之后就是给我儿子变装了
Yup. That's what would happen next.

303
00:13:47,145 --> 00:13:48,900
她们怎么这么久不出来
What's the hold up back there?

304
00:13:48,900 --> 00:13:51,520
人们都在下注打赌 说我带着妓女
People are placing bets that I'm halfway to Reno

305
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,220
和婚礼的礼金在去往里诺的路上了
with a hooker and the wedding cash.

306
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:56,120
别紧张 经过地铁大战后
Relax. After that subway,

307
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:58,660
麦克斯和卡洛琳需要点时间梳洗打扮
Max and Caroline needed some time to freshen up.

308
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,920
她们来时身上一股咱们餐厅
They came smelling like that diner cheese

309
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,280
我说还"没坏"的起司味道
I tell you all is still good.

310
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:05,520
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

311
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:10,680
我们就像苏菲的翻版 真是松了一口气
We look just like Sophie! I am so relieved.

312
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,700
我还以为会穿着太夸张 没想到只是奶太小
I thought I'd be way overdressed but I'm just under-boobed.

313
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,280
是啊 我们赶时间
Yeah, we were in a hurry

314
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:16,840
不然我可以借她一个罩杯
or I would have loaned her a cup of mine.

315
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:19,660
好的
All right.

316
00:14:20,140 --> 00:14:22,160
奥列格 不许那样打量我们
Oleg, stop looking at us like that.

317
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:25,060
没关系 你们都要嫁给我了
It's okay. I'm marrying you.

318
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:28,200
你们看起来像四顶尖合唱团
You guys look like the Four Tops.

319
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:30,180
两个顶 一个腚
Well, two tops and a bottom.

320
