奥列格 苏菲不想让你提前看见她
Oleg, Sophie doesn't want you to see her.

321
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:39,800
骑上栗宝走红毯吧
Jump on Chestnut and start down the aisle.

322
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:41,980
栗宝 对不起 宝贝
And Chestnut, I'm sorry, baby.

323
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:44,280
我知道你不喜欢男扮女 玩变装
I know you never wanted to do drag.

324
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,640
阿憨 你拿着这个
And, Han, you're supposed to take this

325
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:51,420
以防红毯上发生什么"屎"
in case something happens in the aisle.

326
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:54,380
我一下从伴郎沦落成铲屎郎了
This just went from best man to worst job.

327
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,160
你们觉得怎么样 姑娘们
What do you think, girls?

328
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:20,000
我看起来像纯洁的处女吗
Do I look like a virgin?

329
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:26,560
听 大号声响起 我该入场了
Oh, listen! I heard the tuba. That's my cue!

330
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:27,640
进去 姑娘们 快去
Go, girls. Go!

331
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:08,400
天啊
Oh, God!

332
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,720
她的婚纱差点害死咱俩
Her dress almost killed us

333
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,960
现在直接把厄尔害死了
and now it killed Earl.

334
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:15,940
多谢大侠
Thanks.

335
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:16,820
我以为要驾白鹤归西了呢
I thought I was a goner.

336
00:16:23,180 --> 00:16:25,578
下面交换誓言
Time for the vows.

337
00:16:25,578 --> 00:16:29,684
上皇冠
Bring the crowns!

338
00:16:29,684 --> 00:16:32,920
戴上皇冠 戴上荣耀
And crowned is married...

339
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:36,200
结为夫妻
with honor.

340
00:16:41,900 --> 00:16:44,260
把皇冠举到他们头上
Raise the crowns to their heads.

341
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:56,460
快开始吧
